# ITERATOR/INCOMPLETE INSERT into every HASH partition: no RocksDB call of this class was made
# ITERATOR/INCOMPLETE UPDATE moving rows between partitions: no RocksDB call of this class was made
# ITERATOR/INCOMPLETE UPDATE in two partitions: every injected failure was handled correctly
# ITERATOR/INCOMPLETE DELETE in every partition: no RocksDB call of this class was made
# ITERATOR/INCOMPLETE REPLACE into HASH partitions: no RocksDB call of this class was made
# ITERATOR/INCOMPLETE pruned range read: every injected failure was handled correctly
# ITERATOR/INCOMPLETE read of explicit partitions: every injected failure was handled correctly
# ITERATOR/INCOMPLETE point reads into HASH partitions: every injected failure was handled correctly
# ITERATOR/INCOMPLETE ADD PARTITION: every injected failure was handled correctly
# ITERATOR/INCOMPLETE DROP PARTITION: every injected failure was handled correctly
# ITERATOR/INCOMPLETE TRUNCATE PARTITION: no RocksDB call of this class was made
# ITERATOR/INCOMPLETE REORGANIZE PARTITION: every injected failure was handled correctly
# ITERATOR/INCOMPLETE COALESCE PARTITION: every injected failure was handled correctly
# ITERATOR/INCOMPLETE ADD HASH PARTITIONS: every injected failure was handled correctly
# ITERATOR/INCOMPLETE INPLACE ADD INDEX on a partitioned table: every injected failure was handled correctly
# ITERATOR/INCOMPLETE OPTIMIZE PARTITION: the statement does not change the state
